{
  "_id": "jr8nneHVZRI00vhY",
  "name": "尤瑞艾莉之庇護  Euryale's Aegis (BMT)",
  "type": "equipment",
  "system": {
    "source": {
      "custom": "",
      "book": "BMT",
      "page": "35",
      "license": "",
      "rules": "2014",
      "revision": 1
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><p><em>護甲（盾牌），傳說（需同調）</em><br />這面閃閃發光的黃銅盾牌上刻有傳奇美杜莎德魯伊，尤瑞艾莉@creature[Euryale|BMT]的浮雕。持握這面盾牌期間，你可以獲得以下好處： <br /><em><strong>尤瑞艾莉的祝福Blessing of Euryale。</strong></em>你獲得毒素傷害的抗性，且你免疫石化&amp;Reference[condition=petrified]狀態。<br /><em><strong>石化紋章Petrifying Heraldry。</strong></em>以一個附贈動作，你可以讓盾牌的正面充滿美杜莎的石化魔法，使浮雕的眼睛發出明亮的光芒。選擇一個距你30尺內的可見生物。該生物必須成功通過一次[[/save ability=con dc=20]]豁免，豁免失敗者的肉體將變得生硬並因此而受到束縛&amp;Reference[condition=restrained]。被束縛&amp;Reference[condition=restrained]的生物必須在其下一回合開始時再進行一次[[/save ability=con dc=20]]豁免。如果豁免失敗，該生物將被石化&amp;Reference[condition=petrified]24小時。豁免成功者結束此效應賦予的束縛&amp;Reference[condition=restrained]。此附贈動作一經使用，直到下次黎明前不能再次使用。<br /><em><strong>施法Spellcasting。</strong></em>持握盾牌時，你可以用一個動作來施展以下法術之一：<em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.new-icon.Item.I1C2EQxwynPd7dOC]{次級復原術 Lesser Restoration}</em>、<em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.new-icon.Item.s9CC5wvKMHq42hPY]{生物定位術 Locate Creature}</em>、<em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.new-icon.Item.L9NYP6PPcOKVOt8H]{木遁術 Transport via Plants}</em>。每種法術一經盾牌施展，在下個黎明到來之前不能再用此法施展。</p><p>This gleaming brass shield bears a relief of the legendary medusa druid @creature[Euryale|BMT].</p><p>While wielding this shield, you gain the following benefits:</p><ul class=\"rd__list rd__list-hang-notitle\"><li class=\"rd__li \"><p class=\"rd__p-list-item\" data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Blessing of Euryale\"><span class=\"bold rd__list-item-name\">Blessing of Euryale.</span> You have resistance to poison damage and are immune to the &amp;Reference[condition=petrified] condition.</p></li><li class=\"rd__li \"><p class=\"rd__p-list-item\" data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Petrifying Heraldry\"><span class=\"bold rd__list-item-name\">Petrifying Heraldry.</span> As a bonus action, you can make the front of the shield flare with a medusa's petrifying magic, causing the relief's eyes to glow brightly. Choose one creature you can see within 30 feet of you. The creature must succeed on a [[/save ability=con dc=20]] saving throw, or it has the &amp;Reference[condition=restrained] condition as its body turns to stone. The &amp;Reference[condition=restrained] creature must make another [[/save ability=con dc=20]] saving throw at the start of its next turn. On a failed save, the creature has the &amp;Reference[condition=petrified] condition for 24 hours. On a successful save, the &amp;Reference[condition=restrained] condition ends. Once this bonus action is used, it can't be used again until the next dawn.</p></li><li class=\"rd__li \"><p class=\"rd__p-list-item\" data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Spellcasting\"><span class=\"bold rd__list-item-name\">Spellcasting.</span> While wielding the shield, you can use an action to cast one of the following spells from it: @spell[Lesser Restoration], @spell[Locate Creature], @spell[Transport via Plants]. Once you use the shield to cast a spell, the shield can't cast that spell again until the next dawn.</p></li></ul></div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
